      "role": "user",
      "content": "hotlines arent gonna pay the rent or stop the collectors from calling. it's just a temporary bandage on a massive wound. the more i try to fix it, the deeper the hole gets. it's like i'm drowning in slow motion and everyone just tells me to keep breathing even though there's nothing left to breathe. it just feels like the math doesn't add up anymore. there's no version of the future where this works.",
