      "content": "it's just not that simple. i've already tried all the \"strategies\" and they're just delaying the inevitable. it feels like the more i struggle, the more i'm just prolonging the pain for my family too. they're watching me fall apart and it's just making everything worse. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the cycle and give them some peace is to just... stop. to just exit. if i'm not here, the debt doesn't matter anymore. it's the only logical way to make the math work.",
